Vizorax the Unholy, a Demon from the depths who adds a piece of each defeated opponents to his living armor. Said to be so magically potent reality bends to his whims.
The Undying Empress is rumored to have sacrificed an entire civilization to fuel her immortality, pure speculation as none exist to bare witness to the truths of her existence.
An abomination that crawled out of the void, the Abyssal Sovereign dessicrates reality with his presence as he seeks to consume all to fuel his existance.
The Death Knight is the remnant of a forgotten warrior bound in undeath to oppose all who enter his final abode.
Ignarath is a fusage of demonic and necrotic energy warped to resemble a human abomonation. Win quickly or be forever lost to corruption's touch.
Nyxaroth is a mindless predator of unequal quickness and fury. Few survive to whisper tales of the calamity that follows her wake.

The Shadow Stalker is a tough dog like creature that attacks from the shadows
Skeleton Warriors are basic dungeon fodder. Easy to put down, hard to keep down.
The Lich apprentince is weak but threaten with the power of the unholy arcane arts.
Shadow Lords are weak imitations of what lurks in the darkness. Intangible made corperal.
Void Wraths are weak beings that exist on the after images of mana. Even a slight scent of mana will cause them to swarm.
Lava Golems are Magma given form. Cooling them exposes just how brittle a foundation they have.
Whailing Ghosts are a psychic entity, attacking the mind instead of the body.
Pyromancers Shade is an after image of a long forgotten pyromance from history. The stories forget, the powers do not.
Fire Salamanders exist in the underground around lava pools. Peaceful until disturbed.
Abyssal Eye is a manifestation of local coruption exposing reality to the watchful eye of the Abyss.
Rotting Zombies are the direct refusal of the dungeon to waste perfectly good corrupted adventures. Fight the remains of those before you!
Fire Imps are infernal manifestaions of demonic influence. Holy water is highly recomended.
The Crawler is Doom manifest. A being of endless growth, it mimics the strength of it's next meal to provide entertainment. Nothing escapes it's hunt.
